<title>JAPAN: June Nikkei SQ seen at around 20,838.88--sources.</title>
<headline>June Nikkei SQ seen at around 20,838.88--sources.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The special quotation for Friday's settlement of June futures and options on the Nikkei 225 stock average was estimated at about 20,838.88, stock market sources said.</p>
<p>The official settlement will be announced by the Osaka bourse after the market closes.</p>
